> This industry analyst[ report is the] first report of[ its] kind[ to] evaluate[ Sales Enable]ment[ solutions] from a brain science perspective. Based on psychologist[ Todd Maddox�]�s research, Amalgam[ Ins]ights has identified 12[ top solutions] to help[ Sales] VPs and[ Sales] Managers to[ better] train their teams[ across] the multiple areas that salespeople must master.
This industry analyst report is the first report of[ its] kind to evaluate[ Sales] Enablement[ solutions] from a brain science perspective. Amalgam[ Ins]ights[�]� Research Fellow[ Todd Maddox] has identified 12[ top solutions] to[ help Sales] VPs and[ Sales] Managers to[ better] train their teams[ across] the multiple areas that salespeople must master based on his 25+ years of research cited[ over] 10,000 times.
Top Takeaways:[ Optim]ized sales training requires effective sales[ enable]ment, people skills, and[ situational awareness]. This research report shows[ that] each of[ these] skills maps[ directly] onto a distinct learning system in the brain.
The tools that[ optimize] training in each learning system are unique making sales enablement and training a complex and fascinating area of study. this report[ briefly] outlines the core abilities and learning systems then reviews a dozen important vendors in this sector from a learning science perspective.
If you have any questions about this report or would like to speak to the author,[ please] contact us at info@amalgaminsights.com. We look[ forward] to[ speaking] with you![][][][][]

